  "notes": {
    "maptitle": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "maxW": 2390,
      "text": "ISC Brewers Guild — member onboarding wizard & portal",
      "w": 240,
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300
    },
    "q1": {
      "fill": "green",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "DECIDED — Draft layer\nWizard and portal edits save to a draft. Preview shows the draft; Publish pushes it live. Applies to already-published (imported) members too.",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 2470,
      "y": 0
    },
    "q2": {
      "fill": "green",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "DECIDED — Member type\nMember confirms the Guild's type, or picks the right one (Guild admin gets an email when they do). Locked after that. Later changes = support request to the Guild admin.",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 2470,
      "y": 420
    },
    "q3": {
      "fill": "green",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "DECIDED — Getting in & when the wizard shows\n'Member Portal' is the only sign-in link in the footer (the old 'Member Sign In' link was removed 27 Sep). Every member sign-in lands in the wizard/portal.\n\nWizard runs until the member confirms type AND clicks Continue on The Basics. After that: portal only, forever, for everyone on that member.",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 2470,
      "y": 760
    },
    "q4": {
      "fill": "green",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "DECIDED — Second editor\nOnce the owner has finished setup, a newly added editor goes straight to the portal. The wizard runs once per member, not once per person.",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 2470,
      "y": 1100
    },
    "q5": {
      "fill": "green",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "DECIDED — One set of editors\nEach wizard step IS a portal section in guided order: same form component, same fields, same save. Wizard = step chrome (Back / Skip / Continue) wrapped around it. Nothing built twice.",
      "w": 400,
      "x": 2470,
      "y": 1440
    },
    "q6": {
      "x": 2470,
      "y": 2080,
      "w": 400,
      "fill": "green",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "DECIDED — Photos & events editor\nOwner invites/removes from People. This role sees only Photos and Events, can't connect a calendar, and publishes (or discards) only Photos — the owner's other draft changes stay put."
    },
    "q7": {
      "x": 2470,
      "y": 2540,
      "w": 400,
      "fill": "blue",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "SYNCED WITH STAGING — 27 Sep 2026\n'Photos & video' is now 'Photos' until video uploads exist. Gallery comes first on that page. Mobile members pick 'What you offer' categories in The basics. US spelling ('color'). Portal menu shows '[Business name] Profile' and People."
    },
    "wiztitle": {
      "kind": "title1",
      "x": -557,
      "y": 3400,
      "maxW": 7960,
      "w": 240,
      "text": "Setup wizard redesign — for review (2 Oct 2026)"
    },
    "wn1": {
      "x": 7603,
      "y": 3700,
      "w": 440,
      "fill": "green",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "DECIDED — Food on kitchen days (2 Oct)\nA \"We have our own kitchen\" switch on the Food section. When it's on, an open day with nothing tagged #food says \"Kitchen open\" instead of \"Bring your own food\". Closed days still say \"Closed\". See board 6 · Events + Food."
    },
    "wn2": {
      "x": 7603,
      "y": 4220,
      "w": 440,
      "fill": "blue",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "HOW TO READ THESE\nBoards are named by the guide's step numbers (1–9). The screen itself counts only the steps your type sees: Producer 8, Mobile 7, Allied 9. Back and Continue are clickable in Play."
    },
    "wn3": {
      "x": 7603,
      "y": 4740,
      "w": 440,
      "fill": "blue",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "BACK EVERYWHERE\nEvery screen after Welcome has Back. The basics → Confirm your type (shows your locked type). Step 4 → The basics. You're live → Review."
    },
    "wn4": {
      "x": 7603,
      "y": 5260,
      "w": 440,
      "fill": "blue",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "SAMPLE DATA\nSample Brewing Co., Sample Taco Truck and Sample Supply Co. are made up. The photos are the Guild site's own. Phone numbers use 555."
    },
    "wn5": {
      "x": 2470,
      "y": 3000,
      "w": 400,
      "fill": "orange",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "HEADS UP — 2 Oct 2026\nThe screen map above still shows the old step order. It gets updated once the redesigned wizard below is approved."
    }
  },
